@startuml
!theme plain
title Context Diagram - Cardiopulmonary Sound Separation Prototype

left to right direction
skinparam dpi 160
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam actorStyle stickman
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #334155
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  FontColor #111827
}

actor "Healthcare Staff" as Staff
actor "Audio Analyst" as Analyst
database "Approved Public\nCardiopulmonary Datasets" as Dataset
rectangle "Machine Learning-Based System for\nCardiopulmonary Sound Separation" as System

Staff --> System : Enter non-identifying audio attributes\nand upload a mixed recording
System --> Staff : Validation feedback, processing status,\npreview and download links

Analyst --> System : Review audio records, select a model,\nrun separation and inspect results
System --> Analyst : File list, job history, separated outputs\nand valid evaluation information

Dataset --> System : Development and evaluation audio

note bottom of System
Prototype scope: separation of heart and lung sounds only.
The system does not provide disease diagnosis or treatment advice.
end note

@enduml
